r_id":"tourism_resources","name":"相生の滝","category":"nature","address":"河川景観 / 滝","source":"国土交通省 国土数値情報","municipality_code":"20384","municipality_pref":"長野県","municipality_name":"飯島町","municipality_code_method":"nearest_centroid","resource_code":"610"},"geometry":{"type":"Point","coordinates":[137.82261657714844,35.680843353271484]}}],"display_comment_original":"飯島町周辺には、近世村の記憶として石曽根村、田切村、本郷村などの旧村名が見える。 この地域には史跡や遺跡、城跡や陣屋跡、寺社や信仰の場に関わる場所が見え、本郷城跡、飯島陣屋、山溝遺跡のような地点が探索の入口になる。 現地では史跡説明板、石曽根村、田切村ゆかりの旧境石標や村の歴史案内板を、既存ピンと照らして歩くと発見しやすい。","story_enrichment":{"samurai_priority_people":[],"notable_people":["大島蓼太","吉川久衛","後藤俊夫","桃澤如水","桃澤夢宅"],"honorary_citizens":[],"tourism_landmarks":["岩間山城","唐沢城","石上神社","五森神社","梅戸神社","勘助稲荷神社","山祇神社","芝宮神社"],"specialties":["馬肉料理","さくら丼","美山錦（酒米）"],"food_culture":[],"historical_domains":[],"heian_place_names":[],"japan_search_support":["俳人大島蓼太と飯島 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/bibnl-97071210","俳人大島蓼太と飯島 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/dignl-14176308","蓼太句集　上 https://jpsearch.go.jp/item/sdcommons_npl-02BK0104170071"],"enrichment_sources":["https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A3%AF%E5%B3%B6%E7%94%BA","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q18700829","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q18647026","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q7827754","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q11537078","https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q102246626","https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%A4%A7%E5%B3%B6%E8%93%BC%E5%A4%AA&keyword=%E9%A3%AF%E5%B3%B6%E7%94%BA"],"enrichment_errors":[],"wikipedia_title":"飯島町","wikipedia_revision_id":"110640406","wikidata_qid":"Q522462","wikipedia_url":"https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%A3%AF%E5%B3%B6%E7%94%BA","japan_search_query_url":"https://jpsearch.go.jp/csearch/jps-cross?csid=jps-cross&keyword=%E5%A4%A7%E5%B3%B6%E8%93%BC%E5%A4%AA&keyword=%E9%A3%AF%E5%B3%B6%E7%94%BA","status":"wikipedia_ok"}}